{"comments":"Verify — Satisfiability checking for layout constraints.\n\nUses Fourier-Motzkin elimination for linear arithmetic over rationals.\nFor integer constraints, this provides a sound (but incomplete) check:\nif FM says UNSAT over rationals, then definitely UNSAT over integers.\n\n## Why Fourier-Motzkin?\n\nAt billion-agent scale, we need agents to quickly determine:\n\"Can this layout even fit?\" before wasting compute on optimization.\n\nFM elimination is:\n- Complete for linear arithmetic over reals/rationals\n- Sound for integers (UNSAT propagates, SAT may be spurious)\n- Pure and deterministic (no FFI, no randomness)\n- Polynomial in practice for layout constraints\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\nFormula → normalize → eliminateAll → checkFeasibility → VerifyResult\n```\n\nStatus: FOUNDATIONAL\n","declarations":[{"children":[{"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Hydrogen","Layout","Verify"],"Witness"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"}],"declType":"dataConstructor"},"sourceSpan":{"end":[111,8],"name":"src/Hydrogen/Layout/Verify.purs","start":[111,3]},"title":"Sat"},{"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[],"declType":"dataConstructor"},"sourceSpan":{"end":[112,10],"name":"src/Hydrogen/Layout/Verify.purs","start":[112,3]},"title":"Unsat"},{"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[],"declType":"dataConstructor"},"sourceSpan":{"end":[113,12],"name":"src/Hydrogen/Layout/Verify.purs","start":[113,3]},"title":"Unknown"},{"comments":null,"info":{"declType":"instance","dependencies":[],"type":{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Data","Eq"],"Eq"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"},{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Hydrogen","Layout","Verify"],"VerifyResult"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"}],"tag":"TypeApp"}},"sourceSpan":{"end":[115,50],"name":"src/Hydrogen/Layout/Verify.purs","start":[115,1]},"title":"eqVerifyResult"}],"comments":"Verification result for constraint satisfiability.\n","info":{"dataDeclType":"data","declType":"data","roles":[],"typeA